{
 "brief": "Israeli airstrikes struck residential areas across central and western Gaza on Tuesday, wounding multiple civilians including children and a woman, Shehab Wire reported. The raids targeted homes in the Nuseirat area, al-Shati refugee camp, and Khan Younis, regions that have absorbed thousands of people displaced by the ongoing conflict.\n\nThe bombardment resumed a pattern of Israeli aerial attacks on densely populated civilian zones. Video and photographic documentation of the strikes was circulated by the news agency, showing damage to residential structures and evidence of the casualties among families sheltering in the camps.",
